<type>(<scope>): <what changed, imperative, no period, <= 60 chars>

<Why, in 1-3 lines: the problem it fixes or the ask behind it, and the effect.>

; ==============================================================================
; DocuShift commit template. Lines starting with ';' are stripped
; (core.commentChar=; is set locally).
;
; Aim: `git log --oneline` gives the point; `git show` adds the why in a few
; lines. The detail lives in docs/planning.md -- point at it, don't copy it.
;
; SUBJECT  <type>(<scope>): <subject>
;   type   feat | fix | docs | refactor | test | build | chore | perf | revert
;   scope  the stage or module: catalog, discovery, downloader, extractor,
;          engines, transforms, reframe, sync, cli, state, config, reporting,
;          utils, docs. Omit it when the change is cross-cutting.
;   Imperative ("add", not "added"), no trailing period, <= 60 chars (72 max).
;   One change per commit; if the subject needs "and", consider two.
;
; BODY     Why, not how -- the diff already shows how. 1-3 lines, wrapped at 72.
;   - Add up to 3 bullets only for changes the subject doesn't cover.
;   - No file-by-file lists, test counts or measurement tables; end with
;     "See planning.md Phase N." when there is more to say.
;   - Say "not yet verified" when that is true.
;   - Quote the user's ask only when the why is not obvious without it.
;
; Example:
;   fix(engines): stop taking third-party topics as the legal page
;
;   Bare "third party" and "legal" matched content topics and moved them
;   out of their chapter in 65 of 953 Flare roots. See planning.md Phase 36.
;
; BEFORE COMMITTING
;   [ ] the phase in docs/planning.md records the decision (once)
;   [ ] a finished phase is moved to docs/history/phases/ with its index row
;   [ ] CONTEXT.md updated if the current state or next step changed
;   [ ] architecture.md / user-guide.md updated for schema, pipeline or CLI changes
;
; FOOTER   Refs: #123 | Closes: #123
;          AI-assisted commits keep the Co-Authored-By trailer.
; ==============================================================================
